# 관측값 공개일을 예보 기준일 다음 날로 바꿔 S09 누수 위반을 만든다.
PREFIX cc: <http://crowdcast.local/ont#>
PREFIX id: <http://crowdcast.local/id/>
PREFIX prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#>
PREFIX cito: <http://purl.org/spar/cito/>
PREFIX dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/>
PREFIX xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>

DELETE { id:obs-28110-sat-nonlocal cc:availableAt ?date }
INSERT { id:obs-28110-sat-nonlocal cc:availableAt '2025-10-05'^^xsd:date }
WHERE { id:obs-28110-sat-nonlocal cc:availableAt ?date }
